  "hook": "Unpopular opinion: a good dating app is a bad business.",
  "beats": [
    {
      "line": "I'm Hakeem. I'm building Align, a dating app played as a card game.",
      "broll": "You, to camera",
      "onScreen": "founder, Align"
    },
    {
      "line": "Here's the dirty secret of dating apps. When it works, you delete it.",
      "broll": "",
      "onScreen": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "So Align is also a card game. Your binder, your packs, your sign cards stay yours.",
      "broll": "Binder (#collection)",
      "onScreen": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "People cancel the app once they find someone. But they keep collecting the cards.",
      "broll": "",
      "onScreen": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "The goal is an app you don't have to leave when it works.",
      "broll": "Couple playing a talk card",
      "onScreen": ""
    }
  ],
  "cta": "Would you keep collecting after you met someone? Be honest.",
